Found during k42: skeid serves no POST /api/generate at all (routes: /api/chat, /api/tags, /api/ps). k42 asked for /api/generate request-level images to become image_url data URLs "likewise"; that needs the route first: prompt/system/images -> one user message (+ system), response as {response, done, ...} NDJSON (not message), plus a manifest decision (the ollama endpoint already claims the root). Helpers exist: Langertha::Skeid::Protocol::image_url_part / image_media_type (magic-byte sniff). Also open: images inside an Anthropic tool_result content array are JSON-stringified into the tool message text (OpenAI tool messages take no image parts) -- decide whether to lift them into a following user message.
